  "title": "U.S. Marines with Marine Heavy Helicopter Squadron (HMH) 461 transport F-35B Lightning II to Marine Corps Air Station Beaufort for permanent static display",
  "description": "U.S. Marines with Marine Heavy Helicopter Squadron (HMH) 461, Marine Aircraft Group 29, 2nd Marine Aircraft Wing (MAW), transit an F-35B Lightning II to Marine Corps Air Station (MCAS) Beaufort, South Carolina, Aug. 27, 2025. The F-35, known as BF-1, was the first F-35 to perform a vertical landing and was transported to MCAS Beaufort for use as a permanent static display. (U.S. Marine Corps photo by Lance Cpl. Bryan Giraldo)",
